      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You shove Dr Braam to the side, grabbing a set of clamps off the table.
          Before he can stop you, you grab at a piece of debris lodged in the patient's
          torso. As if by miracle, Mr Cobb awakens. The victory is short lived, as
          he then lets out a scream and passes out from the pain, blood seeping from
          the wound.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
