        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Well, I suppose I've managed to stem the bleeding from earlier. Mr
          Cobb should at least be stable for now. I'd better come with you to make
          sure that anyone injured received <i>proper</i> medical care. Just try
          not to butcher any other victims.
