        value: 5
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Yes, well, even if that were possible under normal circumstances,
          all of our resources must remain focused on getting off the island. Once
          the captain returns we could discuss the matter of rewards.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 7
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
