      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It's good to see yet another member of the Albatross crew returned
          to us. Though I would speak with the good doctor if you haven't yet; it
          seems that your journey has been a hard one. We'll need all the good hands
          we can get if we're to escape from this island. When the captain returns
          he'll find the finest crew this side of The Dontrians.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 7
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
