      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Sailing through the Swirling Sea is no small task, and even the most
          experienced seamen are subject to its unpredictable storms. Captain Mariner
          has assured me of the importance of this voyage, and I've never seen him
          more dogged as this. When he spotted pirate sails on the horizon, there
          could be no mistaking our task before the threat.
