      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: As you approach the two figures seated at the fire, they're conversation
          comes to a halt and they turn to look at you. Neither says a word and the
          silence hangs as they wait to see what you will do. The man in the heavy
          coat slowly places his hand on the hilt of a cutlass hanging from his belt.
        type: 0
