      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Look, this isn't a charter ship. If you can prove yourself useful
          and get us that map to get out of this infernal sea then we'll reward you
          by bringing you along with us, but that's it. We're not taking on a boat
          load of extra passengers who are likely none too happy with us.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
