      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It details how over the past three months the captain had grown obsessed
          with finding the lost City of Uruzar. Far from a mere myth conjured up
          to convince sailors to seek their fortune mapping out the treacherous waters
          of the Arcane Isles, he was convinced it was real.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 17
      isRoot: 0
