        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I know we set out to find survivors, but I've devoted myself as a
          student of the natural world just as much as medicine. It would almost
          be irresponsible to pass up such an opportunity as this. Whatever Captain
          Taylor was looking for here much have been important.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
