    - id: 32
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 5
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Whatever this place is, it's clear that it's more than just a stone
          building on a forgotten island. The Arcane Isles are filled with undiscovered
          artifacts and secrets, and whatever the captain found was right when it
          said that something big was in this place.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 17
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 17
        originDialogueID: 32
        destinationConversationID: 17
        destinationDialogueID: 24
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 872.0159
        y: 1729.2124
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 33
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 5
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'I only knew that The Albatross was to set sail for the Arcane Isles
          with enough supplies to last months and that the captain had undisclosed
          destinations he intended to visit. I offered my services as someone who
          has studied the mystic nature of this place, but he was adamant about keeping
          certain details of the voyage private. '
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 17
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 17
        originDialogueID: 33
        destinationConversationID: 17
        destinationDialogueID: 34
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      - originConversationID: 17
        originDialogueID: 33
        destinationConversationID: 17
