    - id: 35
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 5
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: My profession is as a surgeon, but my passion is one of understanding.
          Whether it be the mechanisms of the human body of the grand nature of the
          world around it, I have devoted my studies to discovering the secrets of
          our universe. I had hoped this expedition into the Arcane Isles would be
          my chance to uncover those secrets firsthand. Now we stand before a monument
          to those secrets.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 17
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 17
        originDialogueID: 35
        destinationConversationID: 17
        destinationDialogueID: 24
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 1043.3834
        y: 1755.1771
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 36
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 5
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'That journal you have in your hands details the late captain''s efforts
          in finding the lost city of Uruzar here in the Arcane Isles. Most think
          it''s a myth, but it looks like he''s found something real, including the
          map to this temple we''re in now. '
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 17
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
