      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It's an austere structure, plain in its form yet far more deliberate
          and precise than the natrural stone that surrounds it, as if the decay
          of eons was unable to mar its form. Its surface is bare save for one single
          object sitting upright in the center.
        type: 0
