      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I've seen these before from my research. Whatever culture lived here
          years ago used them to store both information as well as magick energy.
          They're incredibly rare, and those who possess them can even transfer their
          power to other items. I once attended a symposium where the professor was
          able to use one to power a lighthouse indefinitely.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
